{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01Kmnu9qPgfVhkurjuaFddrp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have the full picture. Let me check the current state of the `_agents/` directory and existing WIM files.\n\n## Current State\nThe project needs a Python validation tool for WIM format compliance. No validator exists yet.\n\n## Problem Identified\nUS-017 requires creating `_agents/wim_format_validator.py` and `_agents/wim_format_rules.json` to validate WIM markdown files against Buku Panduan WIM Edisi 2020 standards.\n\n## Planned Changes\n- Create `_agents/wim_format_rules.json` — regex patterns and required section definitions\n- Create `_agents/wim_format_validator.py` — main validator with filename/heading/bilingual checks, JSON report output, exit code logic\n\n<plan>\n{\n  \"files_to_create\": [\"_agents/wim_format_validator.py\", \"_agents/wim_format_rules.json\"],\n  \"files_to_modify\": [],\n  \"functions_to_add\": [\"validate_filename\", \"validate_headings\", \"validate_bilingual_density\", \"scan_directory\", \"compute_compliance_score\", \"generate_report\", \"main\"],\n  \"estimated_loc\": 175\n}\n</plan>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1997,"cache_read_input_tokens":30197,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1997},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aaee2f5e-93ba-4cfc-ba1d-6dc38a3b3b8b","uuid":"921bf1d0-c5c6-4115-9da9-b14fcfe1207b"}
