{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BBcF95JZFC7pt3TFMRDbnb","type":"tool_result","content":"# KERTAS PENERANGAN / INFORMATION SHEET\r\n\r\n**Kod WIM / WIM Code:** G452-010-3:2023-C01/KP(1/3)\r\n**Muka / Page:** 1\r\n**Kertas Warna / Paper Color:** PUTIH / WHITE\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Competency Unit: Perform BEV Scheduled Maintenance\r\n## Work Activity 1: Carry Out BEV Schedule Maintenance Workplace Preparation\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Objektif Pembelajaran / Learning Objectives\r\n\r\nUpon completion of this Information Sheet, trainees will be able to:\r\n1. State the licensing, legislative, and regulatory requirements applicable to BEV maintenance\r\n2. Explain BEV scheduled maintenance safety, health, and environment guidelines\r\n3. List the tools and equipment required for BEV scheduled maintenance\r\n4. Describe hazard identification procedures in a BEV workshop environment\r\n5. Explain scheduled waste management procedures for BEV maintenance\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 1. BEV Rules and Regulations (Peraturan dan Undang-undang BEV)\r\n\r\n### 1.1 Licensing Requirements (Keperluan Pelesenan)\r\n\r\nBattery Electric Vehicle maintenance and repair activities in Malaysia are governed by several regulatory authorities. Technicians and workshops must comply with the following licensing requirements:","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aaee2f5e-93ba-4cfc-ba1d-6dc38a3b3b8b","uuid":"844c7f1e-2466-472b-a561-1c400bda7ec8","timestamp":"2026-04-16T16:40:07.417Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# KERTAS PENERANGAN / INFORMATION SHEET\r\n\r\n**Kod WIM / WIM Code:** G452-010-3:2023-C01/KP(1/3)\r\n**Muka / Page:** 1\r\n**Kertas Warna / Paper Color:** PUTIH / WHITE\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Competency Unit: Perform BEV Scheduled Maintenance\r\n## Work Activity 1: Carry Out BEV Schedule Maintenance Workplace Preparation\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Objektif Pembelajaran / Learning Objectives\r\n\r\nUpon completion of this Information Sheet, trainees will be able to:\r\n1. State the licensing, legislative, and regulatory requirements applicable to BEV maintenance\r\n2. Explain BEV scheduled maintenance safety, health, and environment guidelines\r\n3. List the tools and equipment required for BEV scheduled maintenance\r\n4. Describe hazard identification procedures in a BEV workshop environment\r\n5. Explain scheduled waste management procedures for BEV maintenance\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 1. BEV Rules and Regulations (Peraturan dan Undang-undang BEV)\r\n\r\n### 1.1 Licensing Requirements (Keperluan Pelesenan)\r\n\r\nBattery Electric Vehicle maintenance and repair activities in Malaysia are governed by several regulatory authorities. Technicians and workshops must comply with the following licensing requirements:","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
